abstract: >-
  OMNeT++/INET simulation sources, analysis pipeline, provenance records and
  regression tests for the LIFESAT spacecraft anomaly-triage study. Two
  experiment generations are kept separate: the detection matrix and the
  cause-discrimination fleet. The latter is the frozen tree the accepted
  1,404-run fleet was executed on. The sealed scoring contract and the
  accepted tools package are deposited with the run artefacts rather than
  with the source, because their identity is the digest of their bytes and
  they cannot be reformatted without breaking it.
keywords:
  - spacecraft cybersecurity
  - digital twin
